24	// DEVDESK-89 step 5 (with step 0 / DEVDESK-101): the command line shows the
25	// suggestion list of docs/ux/command-suggestions.md instead of the horizontal
26	// view picker. These tests read the screen (View, stripped of ANSI) and the
27	// header's shortcuts; they do not touch the router's fields.
